OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CGroup awarded licence to run tourist   
OL,5,Cboard                                  
OL,6,GA group of industry leaders has been   
OL,7,Glicensed to run Cornwall's official    
OL,8,Gtourism board.                         
OL,10,FThe independent, not-for-profit        
OL,11,FCornwall Visitor Alliance has secured  
OL,12,Fa licence agreement with the council   
OL,13,Fto operate Visit Cornwall.             
OL,15,FVisit Cornwall went into liquidation   
OL,16,Flast October due to what a             
OL,17,Fspokesperson called "insurmountable    
OL,18,Ffinancial problems".                   
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
