OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CMurder accused tells jury he is not    
OL,5,Chomophobic                             
OL,6,GA 19-year-old accused of murdering a   
OL,7,Gman by pushing him into a marina has   
OL,8,Gtold his trial he is not homophobic.   
OL,10,FLayton Randle, 19, of Oakfield Terrace 
OL,11,FRoad, Plymouth, denies murdering Drew  
OL,12,FPerham at King Point Marina in         
OL,13,FPlymouth on 24 January.                
OL,15,FPlymouth Crown Court heard Randle had  
OL,16,Fadmitted manslaughter and accepted he  
OL,17,Fattacked the 24-year-old and caused    
OL,18,Fhis death, but does not accept he      
OL,19,Fintended to kill or cause him really   
OL,20,Fserious harm.                          
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
