OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,C'Monster' gym abuser given 18 more     
OL,5,Cyears in prison                        
OL,6,GA "monster" who used the gym he owned  
OL,7,Gto abuse and "degrade" women has been  
OL,8,Gsentenced to a further 18 years in     
OL,9,Gprison.                                
OL,11,FDavid Flowers, 43, who owned the       
OL,12,FArmoury Gym in Brislington, Bristol,   
OL,13,Fis already serving a nearly six-year   
OL,14,Fprison sentence for assaulting two     
OL,15,Fwomen in 2021.                         
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
