OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CMan sentenced over 'premeditated'      
OL,5,Chammer attack                          
OL,6,GA man who repeatedly hit his victim on 
OL,7,Gthe head with a hammer in a            
OL,8,G"premeditated violent attack" has been 
OL,9,Gsentenced to a minimum of six years in 
OL,10,Gprison.                                
OL,12,FNathan Scholey, 32, assaulted a man in 
OL,13,Fhis 40s following an argument on       
OL,14,FMelksham High Street, in Wiltshire, on 
OL,15,F17 October.                            
OL,17,FScholey, of no fixed abode, previously 
OL,18,Fdenied the attack but was found guilty 
OL,19,Fof inflicting grievous bodily harm     
OL,20,Fwith intent by a jury at Winchester    
OL,21,FCrown Court.                           
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
